### NetBeans ###
/nbproject/private/
/nbbuild/
# /dist/ is excluded by NetBeans convention, but we deliberately check in the compiled
# parser jar there as a build artifact (see design.md's jar build strategy) — negating a
# file inside an excluded directory doesn't work in gitignore, so the directory itself
# must be un-excluded first.
/dist/*
!/dist/parser.jar
!/dist/README.md
/nbdist/
/.nb-gradle/

